        "id": "ironstance",
        "type": "path",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Two Actions\" aria-label=\"Two Actions\">1</span></p><p><em>You hold your weapon high, prepared to deliver a crushing blow downward when your opponent shows weakness.</em></p><p>While in this stance, you gain an advantage on <strong>Insight</strong> tests. Additionally, when a character within your reach misses you or grazes you with an attack, you can use @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.QpFIxaoCBezzt6yw]{Reactive Strike} against them as if they had voluntarily left your reach.</p>",
            "chat": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Two Actions\" aria-label=\"Two Actions\">1</span></p><p>Enter Ironstance: You gain an advantage on <strong>Insight</strong>, and when you’re grazed or missed, you can make a @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.QpFIxaoCBezzt6yw]{Reactive Strike} against your attacker.</p>",
            "short": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Two Actions\" aria-label=\"Two Actions\">1</span></p><p>While in this stance, you gain an advantage on <strong>Insight</strong> tests. Additionally, when a character within your reach misses you or grazes you with an attack, you can use @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.QpFIxaoCBezzt6yw]{Reactive Strike} against them as if they had voluntarily left your reach.</p>"
        },
